                             "h":  "Welcome to SS2 Literature in English - Second Term",
                             "p":  [
                                       "Welcome to SS2 Literature in English, Second Term. This term is about prose. You learn the building blocks of a story (plot, character, setting, theme and point of view) and apply them to two novels: Redemption Road by Elma Shaw (African) and Path of Lucas by Susanne Bellefeuille (non-African).",
                                       "An important warning: the lesson note for both novels described events that do not match published descriptions of the books. These units give the story as other guides describe it and explain the difference. Always read the novels themselves."
